== block 7: coverage (R7) for an imitator that is a rule computed from the recorded answers
  24 random scaffolds (L <= 3, inputs that depend on the answers), the rule 'the recorded answer, or a fixed default',
    every nonempty set Q of the 4 inputs (360 cases), n = 4 to 6 rounds: the sum over the rounds of
    Pr[the run of the round enters Q and no earlier question lay in Q] is at most L in every case; largest ratio to L 1.0000
